Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:36:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Consumer review: the running relay pins SESSIONS_FACTORY
 (root evidence); its network API still reads the book key

Root's read-only check (custody-v2-live-20261023/evidence/relay-session-authority.json,
20:35Z): SESSIONS_FACTORY = 0x1F5c887c (the original factory), api-relay.js
sha256 481f0041. That file equals nucbox-tls-20261021/combined/payload/api-relay.js:
- the custody gate and the sessions service use the pin, so they are unchanged;
- createNetworkApi passes only addressBook, so owner network-policy/BYO signatures
  for the four 0xb794 deployments start verifying for 0x0b2d after activation.
No private configuration is copied.
---
 CONSUMERS.md |  6 ++++--
 RESULT.md    | 20 +++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

